<Position>10.038202,76.978851,0.000000</Position>
<Visual>edit_NoCaret</Visual>
<Text>Windows Connect Now is a simple and secure way of configuring wireless devices. On a computer running Windows XP SP2 or later, download Windows Connect Now settings to a USB flash drive. Ensure your wireless adapter is connected to your console and powered on. Plug the flash drive into this console to automatically transfer the settings to your wireless adapter. For more info, see www.xbox.com/setup.</Text>
<ReadOnly>true</ReadOnly>
<Multiline>true</Multiline>
<SmoothScroll>true</SmoothScroll>
</Properties>
</XuiEdit>
